{
  "source": "Prompts/layers-2.mp4",
  "duration": 167.8803125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.7,
      "text": "Have you ever read a passage in English class that only made sense after you went back and"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.7,
      "end": 5.34,
      "text": "read it a few times?"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.94,
      "end": 6.5,
      "text": "Try this sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.24,
      "end": 10.14,
      "text": "You might need to read it more than once before the full thought resolves."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.02,
      "end": 12.5,
      "text": "The horse raced past the barn."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.2,
      "end": 13.34,
      "text": "Fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.34,
      "end": 15.8,
      "text": "On the first read, it doesn't make sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.54,
      "end": 19.28,
      "text": "You reach fell, and the sentence seems to stop short."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 20.72,
      "text": "So you read it again."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.4,
      "end": 22.58,
      "text": "Wait, did a barn fall?"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.26,
      "end": 25.36,
      "text": "Did the horse race past the barn afterward?"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.08,
      "end": 27.92,
      "text": "You try each possibility against the words."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.92,
      "end": 31.46,
      "text": "Fell could go with the barn, or with the horse."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.32,
      "end": 33.78,
      "text": "Finally, the structure makes sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.7,
      "end": 37.42,
      "text": "Someone raced a horse past a barn, then the horse fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.14,
      "end": 41.5,
      "text": "Raced describes the horse, and fell is what the horse did."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.18,
      "end": 44.3,
      "text": "The horse passes the barn, then the horse falls."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.12,
      "end": 47.74,
      "text": "Working the sentence out depends on each repeated pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.28,
      "end": 52.06,
      "text": "With every read, you update the meaning of the words until the whole thought is clear."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.94,
      "end": 54.16,
      "text": "AI does something similar."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.58,
      "end": 56.4,
      "text": "It builds meaning through repeated updates."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.18,
      "end": 58.52,
      "text": "But the comparison stops there."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.2,
      "end": 61.08,
      "text": "AI doesn't read your message the way you do."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.58,
      "end": 64.26,
      "text": "It processes your text through a series of internal layers."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 70.44,
      "text": "Within each layer, attention and transformation work together to update numerical values, helping"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.44,
      "end": 72.3,
      "text": "the system work out what your words mean together."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.16,
      "end": 75.82,
      "text": "Those updated numbers pass sequentially to the next layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.46,
      "end": 80.76,
      "text": "Like rereading a difficult sentence, the process builds continuously on what came before."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.36,
      "end": 83.92,
      "text": "The whole stack of layers is called a neural network."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.92,
      "end": 87.16,
      "text": "This diagram shows how layers update numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.64,
      "end": 90.44,
      "text": "Numbers go in one side, and final numbers come out the other."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.04,
      "end": 94.6,
      "text": "The starting numbers here are 0.42 and negative 1.15."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.2,
      "end": 99.76,
      "text": "After moving through the stack, the final numbers are 0.19 and negative 1.12."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.4,
      "end": 102.22,
      "text": "The values shift at every layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.9,
      "end": 105.52,
      "text": "Attention and transformation update the numbers at each layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.02,
      "end": 108.4,
      "text": "Now let's follow a single word through that process."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.98,
      "end": 111.16,
      "text": "This infographic shows how AI connects words."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.16,
      "end": 114.54,
      "text": "At the start, the word it could refer to different things."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.32,
      "end": 119.06,
      "text": "In layer 1, numbers begin to capture its connection to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.66,
      "end": 122.12,
      "text": "By layer 2, they carry concrete information."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.06,
      "end": 126.92,
      "text": "Each layer builds on the previous until reaching a finished state."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.68,
      "end": 130.2,
      "text": "AI works out that it refers to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.86,
      "end": 132.9,
      "text": "The horse sentence took a few reads to untangle."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.66,
      "end": 137.76,
      "text": "Sarcasm, story twists, and complicated reasoning take even more work."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.48,
      "end": 143.42,
      "text": "AI's layers give it the steps required to methodically work through those complex relationships."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.2,
      "end": 149.34,
      "text": "Publish designs show that these AI models use dozens of layers, and sometimes more than 100."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.04,
      "end": 151.64,
      "text": "You can't just keep adding layers forever."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.52,
      "end": 154.86,
      "text": "More layers require more computing power and time."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.56,
      "end": 157.54,
      "text": "The extra benefit has to be worth the cost."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.94,
      "end": 160.74,
      "text": "Meaning builds up, layer by layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.38,
      "end": 162.46,
      "text": "Attention and transformation."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.46,
      "end": 164.06,
      "text": "Dozens of times."
    }
  ],
